#: ../../maths/greeks.md:1 268a8c043cfe45b3b8156f920ba0b108
msgid "Greeks and the other result kinds"
msgstr "希臘字母與其他結果"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:3 0d19f3b37b2640b3a7ad09a3dc3ba072
msgid ""
"Nineteen result kinds are served. Fifteen of them are derivatives of the "
"price; four are quantities of a different sort — a probability, an "
"implied volatility, a fair rate and a basis-point value."
msgstr "本服務提供十九種結果。其中十五種是價格的導數；另外四種是不同性質的量——一個機率、一個隱含波動率、一個公平利率，以及一個基點價值。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:7 07c7949eb768469fb747b4987d116d3d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every formula below is the European analytic case, which is what "
"QuantLib's `BlackCalculator` computes "
"(`ql/pricingengines/blackcalculator.cpp`). Other engines either "
"differentiate their own solution or **do not publish the quantity at "
"all**, which is why so many rows come back \"not supplied\" "
"({doc}`../HANDLERS`)."
msgstr "以下每個公式都是歐式解析解的情形，也就是 QuantLib 的 `BlackCalculator`（`ql/pricingengines/blackcalculator.cpp`）所計算的內容。其他引擎要嘛對自己的解求導，要嘛**根本不發布該量**，這也是為什麼有那麼多列回來是「未提供」（{doc}`../HANDLERS`）。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:13 3fa4ce32c78048dda946bcec7f5ec0ef
msgid "The derivatives"
msgstr "各項導數"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:15 7c6676d48b2a41688b5bf864a4cad7da
