#: ../../maths/greeks.md:34 53502367770249c5ac27b8735869af04
msgid ""
"**Delta forward** is the delta with respect to the forward rather than "
"the spot, which is the hedge ratio you want when the hedge instrument is "
"a forward rather than the stock. The two differ by the carry: $\\partial "
"V/\\partial S = (D_q/D_r)\\,\\partial V/\\partial F$."
msgstr "**遠期 delta** 是對遠期價而非現貨的 delta，也就是當避險工具是遠期合約而不是股票時你要的避險比率。兩者差在持有成本：$\\partial V/\\partial S = (D_q/D_r)\\,\\partial V/\\partial F$。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:39 a1e405de8212478cb1937c551e651951
msgid ""
"**Elasticity** is delta scaled into a percentage-for-percentage figure: "
"how many percent the option moves for one percent on the underlying. It "
"is large and negative for out-of-the-money puts, and it is the natural "
"units for comparing options of very different premiums."
msgstr "**彈性**把 delta 換算成百分比對百分比的數字：標的每動百分之一，選擇權動百分之幾。對價外賣權而言它又大又負，而它是比較權利金差異極大的選擇權時最自然的單位。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:44 2e18ad04a4f749e1966f1f5f64522ed3
msgid ""
"**Theta per day** is simply the annual figure divided by 365 — a calendar"
" convention, not a day count. Over a weekend the realised decay is three "
"of these, not one."
msgstr "**每日 theta** 就只是年化值除以 365——一種曆日慣例，不是日計方式。跨過一個週末，實現的耗損是三個這樣的量，不是一個。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:48 6021ba3c5429452baae2183dabf5ed3e
msgid "The probability"
msgstr "機率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:50 f33f8586728b413eb6e10d19598d27eb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{ITM cash probability} = N(d_2)\\ \\text{(call)},\\qquad N(-d_2)\\ "
"\\text{(put)}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:52 043fe68fe3884847a51076dc0ccec7a8
msgid ""
"This is the risk-neutral probability that the option finishes in the "
"money — which is also, up to the discount factor, the price of a cash-or-"
"nothing option paying one unit. It is *not* a real-world probability: it "
"carries the risk-neutral drift $r-q$, not the asset's expected return."
msgstr "這是選擇權到期落在價內的風險中立機率——它同時也是（差一個折現因子）支付一單位現金的現金或零選擇權的價格。它*不是*真實世界的機率：它帶的是風險中立漂移 $r-q$，不是資產的預期報酬。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:57 31b3f34022fd4dc2b7cbda929a82a394
msgid "Implied volatility"
msgstr "隱含波動率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:59 bc2031d202334ba4a68ef4e019164718
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The only result computed from an input the request carries rather than "
"from the market. Given a target price $V^{\\ast}$, it solves"
msgstr "唯一由請求自帶的輸入、而非由市場算出的結果。給定目標價格 $V^{\\ast}$，它求解"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:62 6fdcb85a2f6a4d058d9e5c2b163af005
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\sigma^{\\ast}: \\quad V(\\sigma^{\\ast}) = V^{\\ast}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:64 493cef02a4fa4eb3a8adcecdab66b334
msgid ""
"by a bracketed root find (QuantLib uses Brent). The price is strictly "
"increasing in $\\sigma$ for a vanilla, so the root is unique when it "
"exists; a target outside the no-arbitrage range has no root and the "
"search fails rather than returning a boundary value."
msgstr "以帶區間的求根法解出（QuantLib 使用 Brent 法）。對一般型而言價格對 $\\sigma$ 嚴格遞增，因此根存在時是唯一的；目標價落在無套利範圍之外時無解，搜尋會失敗，而不是回傳一個邊界值。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:69 f7dc28049edb4db48daf04471b8f41b8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Supply the bracket and tolerance if the default search is too wide or too"
" loose. QuantLib can invert a vanilla, a barrier and a double barrier; on"
" any other style the kind comes back named absent. See {doc}`numerics` "
"for what the root find costs."
msgstr "若預設的搜尋範圍太寬或容忍度太鬆，請自行提供區間與容忍度。QuantLib 能反推一般型、障礙與雙障礙；其他任何類型上，該種類會被指名為缺席。求根的代價見 {doc}`numerics`。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:74 4eaa3e23ba0d47c2a34f6bc395c6235a
msgid "The quanto trio"
msgstr "quanto 三兄弟"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:76 803a714d11a74034bc8e6dad4d08f4bd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These are sensitivities to the *foreign* leg of a quanto trade "
"({doc}`quanto`):"
msgstr "這三項是對 quanto 交易*外幣*那一側的敏感度（{doc}`quanto`）："

#: ../../maths/greeks.md d54c37f678e74ef6b000d703f1db5dd7
msgid "qrho"
msgstr "qrho"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 0cba609584af425ca68ff6b2f2a4b6a2
msgid "$\\partial V/\\partial r_f$, the foreign risk-free rate"
msgstr "$\\partial V/\\partial r_f$，外幣無風險利率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 6ca83b94b3104508812f1850f7d409af
msgid "qvega"
msgstr "qvega"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 03ffde3491b14462a747d64782b81627
msgid "$\\partial V/\\partial \\sigma_X$, the FX volatility"
msgstr "$\\partial V/\\partial \\sigma_X$，匯率波動率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 7934435dc77f4f0795826196272684ba
msgid "qlambda"
msgstr "qlambda"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md b179d06dab9a46e599d25ffb233f75de
msgid "$\\partial V/\\partial \\rho$, the correlation between asset and FX rate"
msgstr "$\\partial V/\\partial \\rho$，資產與匯率之間的相關係數"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:85 0d18fdf072ab43a98b9eb0330a971536
msgid ""
"They exist because the quanto adjustment enters the drift through exactly"
" those three quantities, so their derivatives are the risk of the "
"adjustment itself. On a non-quanto trade they come back unavailable."
msgstr "它們之所以存在，是因為 quanto 調整正是透過這三個量進入漂移項，所以它們的導數就是這項調整本身的風險。在非 quanto 交易上，它們回來時標為無法提供。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:89 1a5a17a8322c40819b28055e95b3a93b
msgid "The swap kinds"
msgstr "利率交換相關的結果"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 5d929d28bd154977a10603fe71f7e36f
msgid "fair rate"
msgstr "公平利率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 1ec980f832984ec09309e4d50b223cfc
msgid "The fixed rate that makes the swap worth zero"
msgstr "使該筆交換價值為零的固定利率"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 1beb37bbc8f14d1aad06edb0c81a1540
msgid "leg NPV"
msgstr "各腳淨現值"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 3fff7888c6954d1f9fc73ee5982ccd44
msgid "The present value of one leg"
msgstr "單一計息腳的現值"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 420fbe1758c04190a9bca4cf2ced1e49
msgid "leg BPS"
msgstr "各腳 BPS"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md 7254663b06684d6c963a764fb0d7073a
msgid "The value of one basis point on a leg"
msgstr "單一計息腳上一個基點的價值"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:97 5dd98db1e79d4f9ab5558526408b04ae
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The formulas are in {doc}`rates`. The fair rate needs exactly two legs, "
"fixed first, then Ibor: any other arrangement is refused rather than "
"answered off the wrong leg."
msgstr "公式見 {doc}`rates`。公平利率需要恰好兩腳，固定腳在前、Ibor 腳在後：其他任何排列都會被拒絕，而不是拿錯的那一腳算給你。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:101 05be60e5476848f182a29e6b9892a115
msgid "Why a greek is missing"
msgstr "為什麼少了某個希臘字母"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:103 5c4cadd2965c40c5bd82fb74374d9fd7
msgid ""
"An engine publishes what its solution gives it cheaply. The analytic "
"European engine differentiates its closed form and has everything above. "
"A binomial tree has delta, gamma and theta from the nodes around the root"
" and **no vega**, because volatility is not a state variable in the tree."
" The American approximations publish almost nothing beyond the price."
msgstr "引擎只發布它的解能便宜給出的東西。歐式解析解引擎對自己的封閉解求導，因此上面每一項都有。二元樹從樹根附近的節點得到 delta、gamma 與 theta，卻**沒有 vega**，因為波動率不是樹裡的狀態變數。美式近似法除了價格之外幾乎什麼都不發布。"

#: ../../maths/greeks.md:109 044cc8ce9fbb446d92935bc7884acc1f
msgid ""
"If you need a greek an engine will not give you, the honest options are "
"to price the same trade on an analytic engine — reading the engine echo "
"on both — or to bump the market yourself with a sweep and difference the "
"ladder, which is a finite-difference greek and says so."
msgstr "若你需要某個引擎不給的希臘字母，誠實的做法有兩個：用解析解引擎為同一筆交易計價——並讀兩邊的引擎回音——或是自己用掃描推動市場，再對階梯圖取差分，那就是一個有限差分的希臘字母，而且它明說自己是。"

